<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus reverse repo yield falls to 4.44 pct.</title>
<headline>Cyprus reverse repo yield falls to 4.44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on a reverse repo auction of 14 day Cyprus bills was 4.44 percent on Tuesday, from 5.73 percent at the previous central bank auction held last November.</p>
